{"height": 7, "weight": 240, "base_experience": 61, "ev_yield": [{"stat": "special-attack", "value": 1}], "genus": "Numb Pokémon", "capture_rate": 255, "base_happiness": 70, "hatch_counter": 20, "growth_rate": "medium", "egg_groups": ["ground"], "gender_rate": 4, "names": [{"language": "ja-hrkt", "name": "ドンメル"}, {"language": "ja-roma", "name": "Donmel"}, {"language": "ko", "name": "둔타"}, {"language": "zh-hant", "name": "呆火駝"}, {"language": "fr", "name": "Chamallot"}, {"language": "de", "name": "Camaub"}, {"language": "es", "name": "Numel"}, {"language": "it", "name": "Numel"}, {"language": "ja", "name": "ドンメル"}, {"language": "zh-hans", "name": "呆火驼"}, {"language": "es-419", "name": "Numel"}], "pokedex_entries": [{"versions": ["ruby"], "text": "NUMEL is extremely dull witted - it doesn’t notice being hit. However, it can’t stand hunger for even a second. This POKéMON’s body is a seething cauldron of boiling magma."}, {"versions": ["sapphire"], "text": "NUMEL stores magma of almost 2,200 degrees F within its body. If it gets wet, the magma cools and hardens. In that event, the POKéMON’s body grows heavy and its movements become sluggish."}, {"versions": ["emerald"], "text": "A NUMEL stores boiling magma in the hump on its back. It is a hardy POKéMON that can transport a 220-pound load. It has served humans at work since long ago."}, {"versions": ["firered", "leafgreen"], "text": "Magma of almost 2,200 degrees Fahrenheit courses through its body. When it grows cold, the magma hardens and slows it."}, {"versions": ["diamond", "pearl", "platinum", "black", "white", "x"], "text": "Its humped back stores intensely hot magma. In rain, the magma cools, slowing its movement."}, {"versions": ["heartgold", "soulsilver"], "text": "The flaming magma it stores in the hump on its back is the source of its tremendous power."}, {"versions": ["black-2", "white-2"], "text": "The magma in its body reaches 2,200 degrees F. Its hump gets smaller when it uses Fire-type moves."}, {"version